{"seq":2,"slug":"query-planning","title":"查询计划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/query-planning","wordCount":744,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"查询计划\">查询计划</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>查询计划</strong>是 SQLite 优化器为一条 SQL 选择的执行策略，包括如何访问表、是否使用索引、以什么顺序连接。<strong>EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</strong> 会输出这份计划（如 <code>SEARCH ... USING INDEX</code> 或 <code>SCAN</code>），是定位性能瓶颈的核心工具。读懂计划中的访问路径，就能判断查询是走索引还是退化为全表扫描。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"explain-query-plan\">EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</h2><p><strong>EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</strong>（简称 EQP）是分析 SQLite 查询执行策略的核心工具。它展示了 SQLite 优化器选择的访问路径、索引使用和连接策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 基本用法&#10;EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = &#39;北京&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 输出示例&#10;-- QUERY PLAN&#10;-- `--SEARCH users USING INDEX idx_users_city (city=?)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 基本用法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '北京'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 输出示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- QUERY PLAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- `--SEARCH users USING INDEX idx_users_city (city=?)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>EQP 输出中的关键词：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关键词</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SCAN table</td>\n<td>全表扫描（未使用索引）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SEARCH table USING INDEX</td>\n<td>使用索引查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COVERING INDEX</td>\n<td>覆盖索引（无需回表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USING ROWID</td>\n<td>通过 rowid 直接查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AUTOMATIC INDEX</td>\n<td>优化器创建的临时自动索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TEMP B-TREE FOR ORDER BY</td>\n<td>使用临时 B-tree 排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USE TEMP B-TREE FOR GROUP BY</td>\n<td>使用临时 B-tree 分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COMPOUND SUBQUERIES</td>\n<td>复合子查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 全表扫描示例&#10;EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE age &gt; 25;&#10;-- `--SCAN users&#10;&#10;-- 索引查找示例&#10;EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = &#39;alice@example.com&#39;;&#10;-- `--SEARCH users USING INDEX sqlite_autoindex_users_1 (email=?)&#10;&#10;-- 覆盖索引示例&#10;EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&#10;SELECT name, email FROM users WHERE city = &#39;北京&#39;;&#10;-- `--SEARCH users USING COVERING INDEX idx_covering (city=?)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 全表扫描示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- `--SCAN users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 索引查找示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- `--SEARCH users USING INDEX sqlite_autoindex_users_1 (email=?)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 覆盖索引示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '北京'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- `--SEARCH users USING COVERING INDEX idx_covering (city=?)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"完整-explain\">完整 EXPLAIN</h2><p><code>EXPLAIN</code>（不带 QUERY PLAN）展示 VDBE 字节码，提供更底层的执行细节：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"EXPLAIN&#10;SELECT name FROM users WHERE city = &#39;北京&#39; LIMIT 10;&#10;&#10;-- 输出：操作码序列&#10;-- addr  opcode          p1    p2    p3    p4             p5&#10;-- ----  --------------  ----  ----  ----  -------------  --&#10;-- 0     Init            0     12    0                    0&#10;-- 1     OpenRead        0     2     0     5              0&#10;-- 2     OpenRead        1     4     0     k(2,,)         0&#10;-- ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '北京'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 输出：操作码序列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- addr  opcode          p1    p2    p3    p4             p5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ----  --------------  ----  ----  ----  -------------  --</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 0     Init            0     12    0                    0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1     OpenRead        0     2     0     5              0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 2     OpenRead        1     4     0     k(2,,)         0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ...</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    EQP[EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&lt;br/&gt;高层策略] --&gt; DECISION[分析访问路径&lt;br/&gt;和索引选择]&#10;    EXPLAIN[EXPLAIN&lt;br/&gt;VDBE 字节码] --&gt; DETAIL[底层执行细节&lt;br/&gt;操作码序列]&#10;    DECISION --&gt; OPTIMIZE[优化查询]&#10;    DETAIL --&gt; DEBUG[深度调试]\">graph TD\n    EQP[EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&lt;br/&gt;高层策略] --&gt; DECISION[分析访问路径&lt;br/&gt;和索引选择]\n    EXPLAIN[EXPLAIN&lt;br/&gt;VDBE 字节码] --&gt; DETAIL[底层执行细节&lt;br/&gt;操作码序列]\n    DECISION --&gt; OPTIMIZE[优化查询]\n    DETAIL --&gt; DEBUG[深度调试]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 日常性能分析主要使用 <code>EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</code>。完整的 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 字节码输出主要用于深度调试或理解 SQLite 内部工作机制。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"索引选择策略\">索引选择策略</h2><p>SQLite 优化器在选择索引时考虑多个因素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;    id          INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    customer_id INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;    total       REAL NOT NULL,&#10;    status      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    order_date  TEXT NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_customer ON orders(customer_id);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_status ON orders(status);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_date ON orders(order_date);&#10;&#10;-- 单索引选择&#10;EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE customer_id = 100;&#10;-- SEARCH orders USING INDEX idx_orders_customer (customer_id=?)&#10;&#10;-- 多条件时的索引选择&#10;EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE customer_id = 100 AND status = &#39;completed&#39;;&#10;-- SQLite 会选择选择性更高的索引\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    customer_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_date  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_customer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(customer_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(order_date);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 单索引选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SEARCH orders USING INDEX idx_orders_customer (customer_id=?)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 多条件时的索引选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SQLite 会选择选择性更高的索引</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选择因素</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等值条件优先</td>\n<td>= 比 &gt; &lt; BETWEEN 更适合索引查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择性</td>\n<td>过滤掉更多行的索引优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖索引优先</td>\n<td>避免回表的索引得到额外加分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引列数</td>\n<td>与查询条件匹配更多列的索引优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序避免</td>\n<td>能同时满足排序需求的索引优先</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 复合索引 vs 多个单列索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_composite ON orders(customer_id, status, order_date);&#10;&#10;EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&#10;SELECT * FROM orders&#10;WHERE customer_id = 100 AND status = &#39;completed&#39;&#10;ORDER BY order_date;&#10;-- SEARCH orders USING INDEX idx_orders_composite (customer_id=? AND status=?)&#10;-- 无需额外排序！\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 复合索引 vs 多个单列索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_composite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(customer_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_date);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SEARCH orders USING INDEX idx_orders_composite (customer_id=? AND status=?)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 无需额外排序！</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动索引\">自动索引</h2><p>当 SQLite 估计创建临时索引的成本低于全表扫描时，会自动创建<strong>自动索引</strong>（Automatic Index）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&#10;SELECT o.id, c.name&#10;FROM orders o&#10;JOIN customers c ON o.customer_id = c.id&#10;WHERE o.status = &#39;pending&#39;;&#10;-- SCAN orders&#10;-- SEARCH customers USING AUTOMATIC COVERING INDEX (id=?)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customers c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SCAN orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SEARCH customers USING AUTOMATIC COVERING INDEX (id=?)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    QUERY[查询到达] --&gt; COST[成本估算]&#10;    COST --&gt;|全表扫描成本 &gt; 建索引成本| AUTO[创建自动索引]&#10;    COST --&gt;|全表扫描成本 &lt; 建索引成本| SCAN[全表扫描]&#10;    AUTO --&gt; SEARCH[使用临时索引查找]\">graph TD\n    QUERY[查询到达] --&gt; COST[成本估算]\n    COST --&gt;|全表扫描成本 &gt; 建索引成本| AUTO[创建自动索引]\n    COST --&gt;|全表扫描成本 &lt; 建索引成本| SCAN[全表扫描]\n    AUTO --&gt; SEARCH[使用临时索引查找]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 禁用自动索引&#10;PRAGMA automatic_index = OFF;&#10;&#10;-- 查看当前设置&#10;PRAGMA automatic_index;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 禁用自动索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA automatic_index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OFF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看当前设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA automatic_index;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果 EQP 频繁显示 AUTOMATIC INDEX，说明缺少持久化索引。应该创建对应的永久索引来避免每次查询都重建临时索引的开销。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见性能反模式\">常见性能反模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SELECT *</td>\n<td>无法使用覆盖索引</td>\n<td>只查询需要的列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数包装索引列</td>\n<td>索引失效</td>\n<td>创建表达式索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LIKE &#39;%keyword%&#39;</td>\n<td>无法使用前缀索引</td>\n<td>使用 FTS5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐式类型转换</td>\n<td>索引失效</td>\n<td>确保类型一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OR 连接不同列</td>\n<td>可能触发全表扫描</td>\n<td>改用 UNION</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无 LIMIT 的大结果集</td>\n<td>内存和 I/O 浪费</td>\n<td>添加 LIMIT</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- ❌ 函数包装索引列&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE lower(name) = &#39;alice&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- ✅ 创建表达式索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_name_lower ON users(lower(name));&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE lower(name) = &#39;alice&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- ❌ OR 连接不同列&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE customer_id = 100 OR status = &#39;pending&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- ✅ 改用 UNION&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE customer_id = 100&#10;UNION&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE status = &#39;pending&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ❌ 函数包装索引列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ✅ 创建表达式索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_name_lower</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ❌ OR 连接不同列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ✅ 改用 UNION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"analyze-与统计信息\">ANALYZE 与统计信息</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 收集统计信息&#10;ANALYZE;&#10;&#10;-- 查看统计数据&#10;SELECT * FROM sqlite_stat1;&#10;-- tbl    idx                         stat&#10;-- users  idx_users_city              1000 50&#10;-- users  idx_users_email_lower       1000 1&#10;&#10;-- stat 列的含义：&#10;-- 第一个数字：表的总行数&#10;-- 后续数字：每个索引列的平均重复行数（选择性的倒数）&#10;&#10;-- 手动更新统计信息（谨慎使用）&#10;DELETE FROM sqlite_stat1;&#10;INSERT INTO sqlite_stat1 VALUES (&#39;users&#39;, &#39;idx_users_city&#39;, &#39;100000 200&#39;);&#10;ANALYZE sqlite_schema;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 收集统计信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看统计数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite_stat1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- tbl    idx                         stat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- users  idx_users_city              1000 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- users  idx_users_email_lower       1000 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- stat 列的含义：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 第一个数字：表的总行数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 后续数字：每个索引列的平均重复行数（选择性的倒数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 手动更新统计信息（谨慎使用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite_stat1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite_stat1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'idx_users_city'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100000 200'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE sqlite_schema;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((查询计划))&#10;    EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&#10;      SCAN 全表扫描&#10;      SEARCH 索引查找&#10;      COVERING INDEX&#10;    索引选择&#10;      等值优先&#10;      选择性高优先&#10;      覆盖索引加分&#10;    自动索引&#10;      临时 B-tree&#10;      成本估算触发&#10;      应替换为永久索引&#10;    反模式&#10;      SELECT *&#10;      函数包装索引列&#10;      隐式类型转换&#10;    ANALYZE&#10;      sqlite_stat1&#10;      选择性统计\">mindmap\n  root((查询计划))\n    EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN\n      SCAN 全表扫描\n      SEARCH 索引查找\n      COVERING INDEX\n    索引选择\n      等值优先\n      选择性高优先\n      覆盖索引加分\n    自动索引\n      临时 B-tree\n      成本估算触发\n      应替换为永久索引\n    反模式\n      SELECT *\n      函数包装索引列\n      隐式类型转换\n    ANALYZE\n      sqlite_stat1\n      选择性统计</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</strong> 是分析查询性能的首要工具，关注 SCAN vs SEARCH 的区别。</li>\n<li>SQLite 优化器根据等值条件、选择性、覆盖索引等因素选择最优索引。</li>\n<li><strong>自动索引</strong>是 SQLite 的自适应优化，但频繁出现说明缺少永久索引。</li>\n<li>避免常见反模式：SELECT *、函数包装索引列、隐式类型转换。</li>\n<li>定期运行 <strong>ANALYZE</strong> 更新统计信息，帮助优化器做出更好的决策。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"查询计划","id":"查询计划"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN","id":"explain-query-plan"},{"level":2,"text":"完整 EXPLAIN","id":"完整-explain"},{"level":2,"text":"索引选择策略","id":"索引选择策略"},{"level":2,"text":"自动索引","id":"自动索引"},{"level":2,"text":"常见性能反模式","id":"常见性能反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"ANALYZE 与统计信息","id":"analyze-与统计信息"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"索引策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/indexing-strategies"},"next":{"title":"WAL 与并发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/wal-and-concurrency"}}